# Confirm the team brain on every team on fresh seeds (TMODE-34, BENCH-153). Team thread: team-only,
# duel and melee fixtures bit for bit. pc-team-concord (PR #494, 46 teams x 12 seeds from 6700): CONCORD
# on every team +0.87 +- 0.53 APS (gate PASS, low end +0.34), but measured on the screen seeds; the
# five-team table +0.35 +- 0.21 on fresh ones. Leigh 2026-10-31 13:04 GMT chose "Global on, plus confirm
# card": master ships CONCORD on every team (FORCE_CONCORD, every named entry), and this card checks it
# against the build before it shipped on seeds it has never seen.
#   c2prep  build aa (master, CONCORD on), ncn (tmnoconcord: CONCORD on no team, the baseline) and
#           bbncn (the same again under its own name, the A/A)
#   c2bb    bbncn vs ncn, 46 teams x 16 fresh seeds (base 6900), 10 rounds as pc-team-concord
#   c2on    aa vs ncn, the same seeds
#   c2sum   projected team APS change = sum of the on arm's per-team gain less half of bb's / 46
#           (gate: +0.30 with the 95% low end above zero). The card changes nothing: on a FAIL a PR
#           turns CONCORD back off, or keeps it only where the two cards agree it pays.
# Each seed is a pair (the arm and ncn): 2 x 46 x 16 x 2 = 2,944 battles, about 3 h at 12 workers
# (sizes itself to the host). Every step resumes where it stopped.
# Stop rules on every battle step (halt; every battle fought is kept and a rerun resumes): 20 failed
# battles (a broken jar), no battle in 30 minutes (a hung step), or 40+ skipped turns a battle over the
# last 100 (the PR #331 build-up; CONCORD ran 10 to 11 a battle on pc-team-concord). A halt at the very
# start leaves the whole card unrun (2,944 battles, about 3 h); a halt in c2bb leaves the rest of c2bb
# plus all 1,472 of c2on; in c2on, the rest of c2on. No early finish on score: the gate is pooled over
# all 46 teams.
# The team thread reads claude/pc-team-concord2-results.
#   ./queue.sh run pc-team-concord2        (or  .\queue.ps1 run pc-team-concord2)
# Run it from master (one bench queue at a time):
#   git checkout master && git pull

set OUT = ../docs/bench/local
set T = python3 tools/team_modes.py

c2prep | git checkout -q master && V=$(sed -n 's:.*<robot.release>\(.*\)</robot.release>.*:\1:p' ../hadur-robot/pom.xml) && test -n "$V" && rm -f bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_"$V"aa.jar bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_"$V"ncn.jar bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_"$V"bbncn.jar && rm -f ${OUT}/team-concord2-*.md && ./fetch-opponents.sh --set team-census46.txt && bash ./build-ablation.sh aa && bash ./build-ablation.sh tmnoconcord && bash ./build-ablation.sh bb,tmnoconcord && mkdir -p work && rm -rf work/team-concord2-"$V"-bb work/team-concord2-"$V"-on && for a in bb on; do sed "s/@V@/$V/g" plans/team-concord2-$a.args > work/team-concord2-$a.args || exit 1; done && for j in aa ncn bbncn; do test -f bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_"$V"$j.jar || exit 1; done && mvn -q compile
c2bb   | mvn -q exec:java "-Dexec.args=@work/team-concord2-bb.args"
  after: c2prep
  watch: battles=1472
  stop: fails 20
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100
c2on   | mvn -q exec:java "-Dexec.args=@work/team-concord2-on.args"
  after: c2bb
  watch: battles=1472
  stop: fails 20
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100
c2sum  | ${T} gate --report ${OUT}/team-concord2-on.md --control ${OUT}/team-concord2-bb.md --set team-census46.txt --seeds 16 --teams 46 --min-aps 0.3 --out-md ${OUT}/team-concord2-verdict.md
  after: c2on
c2pr   | bash tools/open_results_pr.sh claude/pc-team-concord2-results "The team brain on every team: fresh-seed confirm" $(ls ${OUT}/team-concord2-*.md 2>/dev/null)
  after: c2sum
